# Final sensitive-file denials must remain after every allowlist negation.
# Docker applies the last matching rule, so these prevent files nested below
# app/, lib/ or public/ from being reintroduced by the broad source allowlist.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/.ssh
**/.ssh/**
**/credentials.json
**/id_ed25519
**/id_rsa
**/secrets.json
**/service-account*.json
**/service_account*.json
**/*.jks
**/*.key
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
